{"version":1,"content":"<p>【11:59】西藏那曲市巴青縣22日晚發生7.0級地震，目前已造成16人遇難、65人受傷，其中重傷11人、輕傷54人。</p><p>目前已安全轉移受災群眾12489人。</p><p>（新華社）【短片：西藏那曲市巴青縣7級地震發生一刻】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:53.107787+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:59:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.570478+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.570478+00:00","content_hash":"523e782ff3d99659eccae0e2820569094e773be7530c711be79a50424dcc7942","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}